Third-Party Dependencies

This software uses the following open-source packages:

- PySide6 (LGPL-3.0) - Qt for Python
  https://www.qt.io/qt-for-python

- NumPy (BSD-3-Clause) - Scientific computing
  https://numpy.org

- rtmidi (MIT) - MIDI I/O library
  https://pypi.org/project/python-rtmidi

These dependencies are installed automatically when running the application.
Their respective licenses apply to their own code.
